OL,3,GNEWSAWest Midlands floods see knee-high
OL,4,Awater, evacuated pubs and people
OL,5,A'losing everything'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Significant flooding" hits parts of
OL,8,FBirmingham and Staffordshire after
OL,9,Fheavy rain
OL,11,FOne business owner says she has 'lost
OL,12,Feverything'
OL,14,FPubs among places to suffer, with one
OL,15,Fseeing water knee-high
OL,17,FRail line floods, disrupting services
OL,19,FThe Met Office has a yellow warning of
OL,20,Fthunderstorms in place for the region
OL,21,Funtil Thursday night, with some
OL,22,Fdisruption anticipated
